cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  i_pDAE is the metric of BindCraft2; please cite BindCraft2 when you use this
  implementation. This repository is a standalone numpy reimplementation of that
  metric and is not the original work.
title: "ipdae: standalone implementation of i_pDAE"
abstract: >-
  A dependency-light (numpy-only) reimplementation of i_pDAE, the distance-masked
  interface confidence score introduced in BindCraft2, runnable from coordinate
  (PDB/mmCIF) and PAE (JSON/NPZ) files.
type: software
references:
  - type: software
    title: "BindCraft2 (source of the i_pDAE metric)"
    repository-code: "https://github.com/PacesaLab/BindCraft2"
    authors:
      - family-names: Pacesa
        given-names: Martin
      - name: "The BindCraft2 contributors"
